\viewkind4\uc1\pard\cf1\ul\b\f0\fs24\'b6 Verse 1\cf0\ulnone\b0 
\par 1. Jesus hath died that I might live,
\par Might live to God alone,
\par In Him, eternal life recieve,
\par And be in spirit one.
\par 
\par \cf1\ul\b\'b6 Verse 2\cf0\ulnone\b0 
\par 2. Saviour, I thank Thee for the grace,
\par The gift unspeakable!
\par And wait with arms of grace to embrace,
\par And all Thy love to feel.
\par 
\par \cf1\ul\b\'b6 Verse 3\cf0\ulnone\b0 
\par 3. My soul breaks out in long desire
\par The perfect bliss to prove;
\par My longing heart is all on fire
\par To be dissolved in love.
\par 
\par \cf1\ul\b\'b6 Verse 4\cf0\ulnone\b0 
\par 4. Give me Thyself-from every boast,
\par From every wish set free;
\par Let all I am in Thee be lost,
\par But give Thyself to me.
\par 
\par \cf1\ul\b\'b6 Verse 5\cf0\ulnone\b0 
\par 5. Thy gifts, alone, cannot suffice
\par Unless Thyself b given;
\par Thy presence makes my paradise,
\par And where Thou art is heaven.\f1 
\par \cf1\ul\b\fs16 
\par }

